{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738750/extras/dc7c4d7b3032dc32b9a2ebf6e11aa0ac.poster.avif?t=1747786132\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738750/extras/dc7c4d7b3032dc32b9a2ebf6e11aa0ac.webm?t=1747786132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738750/extras/dc7c4d7b3032dc32b9a2ebf6e11aa0ac.mp4?t=1747786132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claymore, the time travelling knight, finds himself in the future, where he must save the world from infectious aliens using his trusty\u2014 wait, what's a gun?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In <i>Knight in Time</i>...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge through hectic waves of aliens</strong> in fast-paced bullet hell combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow stronger</strong> by <i>(misusing)</i> various guns and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the truth</strong> of what happened here. There is more than meets the eye...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738750/extras/38c91703a7e380150c7f4f33e583a7a0.poster.avif?t=1747786132\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738750/extras/38c91703a7e380150c7f4f33e583a7a0.webm?t=1747786132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738750/extras/38c91703a7e380150c7f4f33e583a7a0.mp4?t=1747786132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p